hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1718","###\n Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim narrated to us, saying: Uthman ibn Umar narrated to us, saying: Yunus narrated to us, from Az-Zuhri, who said: Hind bint Al-Harith narrated to me, that Umm Salamah, the wife of the Prophet (ﷺ), informed her, saying: \During the time of the Prophet (ﷺ)"," when the women finished the obligatory prayer"," they would stand up and leave immediately. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and the men"""
